{"title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Controllers","description":null,"products":[{"product_id":"nintendo-joy-con-2-pair-light-blue-and-light-red","title":"Nintendo Switch™ 2 Joy-Con™ 2 Pair (L)\/(R) - Light Blue and Light Red","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eJoy-Con 2 controllers: Left and right Joy-Con 2 controllers; includes two Joy-Con 2 straps; the updated Joy-Con 2 controllers have easy-to-use motion controls and HD rumble 2, along with the new C Button for easy GameChat access and all-new mouse controls in compatible games\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThis set includes both a left and right Joy-Con 2 controller, along with a pair of Joy-Con 2 straps, for local multiplayer with a friend in compatible games; only for use with Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Nintendo Switch 2 console comes with one Joy-Con 2 L and one Joy-Con 2 R, and two Joy-Con 2 straps\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47035051671774,"sku":"","price":78.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_bdefef1b-bf68-45e4-ae39-a9e2ce818533.jpg?v=1750798905"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch-2-pro-controller","title":"Nintendo Switch 2 Pro Controller","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTake your gaming to the next level with the Nintendo Switch™ 2 Pro Controller. Features include: • HD Rumble 2 • Motion controls • Built-in amiibo™ functionality* • Capture Button • C Button for GameChat** • Programmable GL\/GR buttons • Audio jack *amiibo not included. **Internet, Nintendo Account and Nintendo Switch Online membership (sold separately) required for GameChat. Not available in all countries.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47059111706846,"sku":null,"price":78.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_f4d04866-09f6-473b-8d7d-30e9e09b116f.jpg?v=1751828764"},{"product_id":"gamesir-g8-plus-bluetooth-mobile-game-controller-for-nintendo-switch-ios-android-tablets-wireless-gamepad-with-hall-effect-joysticks-hall-trigger","title":"GameSir G8 Plus Bluetooth Mobile Game Controller for Nintendo Switch 1\/2, iOS, Android \u0026 Tablets, Wireless Gamepad with Hall Effect Joysticks\/Hall Trigger","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"G8 Plus\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0682c15d-1b21-469f-a946-bb1d5b6b20f5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/0682c15d-1b21-469f-a946-bb1d5b6b20f5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"ifvsqo-642p5u-alj4kk-4pc33y\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"btxxpd-eu0nto-2r5brp-x4k1nr\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"65cfn4-81qv49-4uke2c-6asmoc\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"G8 Plus\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a81bc556-be0c-422c-9907-bb5b575b8340.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/a81bc556-be0c-422c-9907-bb5b575b8340.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"d7tige-xhn6gu-7lsm06-pwcio4\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"G8 Plus\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7ef8f5a1-5447-4201-8d8d-e54cef8867a7.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7ef8f5a1-5447-4201-8d8d-e54cef8867a7.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"3psfaj-sq2bu7-ruwq1w-ouxvey\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003ch1 class=\"a-text-center aplus-container-3 aplus-h1 a-text-bold\"\u003eAttention: the G8 Plus is not compatible with PS4\u003c\/h1\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"G8 Plus\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/091abcd5-d6f4-4ede-abe4-8acb666f2eff.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/091abcd5-d6f4-4ede-abe4-8acb666f2eff.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"8vjcn1-9k7a5z-5ymt9s-405rbh\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"G8 Plus\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/07d568f7-3019-478d-8580-cffaca8d9134.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/07d568f7-3019-478d-8580-cffaca8d9134.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.png\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"aplus-description aplus-container-3 aplus-p1\"\u003eWe recommend not using a phone case with this controller. If a case must be used, please ensure it meets these specifications: maximum 1mm thickness and non-slip surface texture.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Gamesir","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47550382702814,"sku":null,"price":65.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_a6bae74d-7746-4667-9d85-4556a0e21ae6.jpg?v=1758568759"},{"product_id":"8bitdo-pro-2-bluetooth-gaming-controller-for-switch-pc-android-and-steam-apple","title":"8BitDo Pro 2 Bluetooth Gaming Controller for Switch, PC, Android, and Steam \u0026 Apple","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003ePlay like a Pro with 8BitDo's most advanced controller to date! An evolution of the SN30 Pro+ in every way at a fraction of the price of competitor Pro controllers \u003c\/span\u003eand compatible with the Raspberry Pi!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pro 2 features two Pro-level back buttons. These buttons give you more control so you don't have to take your thumbs off the thumbsticks. With 8BitDo Ultimate Software you can assign any button function and macros, too.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMore ways to play. Custom Profile Switching. Enhanced grip. 4-way Mode Switching button.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pro 2 gives you more ways to play. The custom profile switch button holds 3 custom profiles that can be switched on the fly. With an enhanced grip, Pro 2 allows you to hold the controller with even less effort. The new 4-way Mode Switch button allows you to instantly switch between Switch, macOS, D-input and X-input so you can pair to any device as easily as possible.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e8BitDo Ultimate Software now on PC, Android and iOS\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUltimate Software gives you elite control over every piece of your controller - now on Android and iOS. Customize button mapping, adjust stick \u0026amp; trigger sensitivity, vibration control and create macros with any button combination. Create controller profiles and switch between them at any time with the custom profile switch.\u003cspan\u003e¹\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMapping\u003c\/strong\u003e: Assign the buttons with the functionality to your liking\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSticks\u003c\/strong\u003e: Customize each stick for a higher precision control\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTriggers\u003c\/strong\u003e: Adjust the ranges of your triggers to act faster\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eVibration\u003c\/strong\u003e: Modify the vibration intensity for a better comfort during gameplay\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMacros\u003c\/strong\u003e: Assign a long sequence and action to one single button\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eA Modern controller that respects the classics\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Pro 2 controller isn't any old Bluetooth® game controller - it was designed with respect for the classics. We paid extra attention to the most critical characteristics like the D-PAD, to make sure it feels exactly like you remember it.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePlay any game, anywhere\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSwitch. Windows. macOS. Android. 8Bitdo controllers are designed to be as versatile as possible with each of your modern devices. Now with a 4-way mode switch, you can instantly pair your controller via Bluetooth®. You can even use Pro 2 as a wired USB controller with the included USB cable.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eCompatibility\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRaspberry Pi\u003c\/strong\u003e: 4B, 3B+, 3B, 2B, Zero (Bluetooth® 2.0 and above)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSwitch\u003c\/strong\u003e: 1.0.0 and above (Switch), 9.0.0 and above (Lite)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eWindows\u003c\/strong\u003e: Windows 7 and above (Bluetooth®4.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003emacOS\u003c\/strong\u003e: 10.10 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAndroid\u003c\/strong\u003e: 4.0 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eSteam\u003c\/strong\u003e: Windows 7 and above, macOS 10.9 and above\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003ePackage Contents\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e8BitDo Pro 2 Bluetooth gamepad\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB cable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eInstruction manual\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eTech Specs\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eSpecial Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e2 Pro back paddle buttons\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCustom Profile switch button, 3 profiles, switch on the fly\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMode switch button (Switch, macOS, D-input, X-input)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUltimate Software on PC and mobile (Android\/iOS)\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEnhanced grip\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eModifiable vibration\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e6 axis motion sensor\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eConnectivity\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eWireless Bluetooth®4.0\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eUSB-C\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eController Mode\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSwitch mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eX-input\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMac mode\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eD-input\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBattery Type \/ Battery Life\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1000mAh Li-on battery, rechargeable\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e20 play hours with 4 hour charging time\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eNotes\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e* Additional system support requires downloading and installing firmware available at support.8bitdo.com\u003cbr\u003e* Switch compatibility does not support HD rumble or amiibo scanning\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan\u003e¹\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe Pro 2 features regular rumble vibration, not HD Rumble.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"8BitDo","offers":[{"title":"Gray","offer_id":47893702836446,"sku":null,"price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Black","offer_id":47893702869214,"sku":null,"price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/1_1716fc82-80f4-41e5-905e-22bd93ad0862.jpg?v=1770904640"},{"product_id":"8bitdo-ultimate-2c-bluetooth-wireless-controller-for-switch-pink","title":"8BitDo Ultimate 2C Bluetooth Wireless Controller for Switch","description":"\u003cp data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"547\"\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-start=\"175\" data-end=\"547\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGamers who demand performance and style right in their hands \u003c\/strong\u003etake your Switch gaming to the next level with the \u003cstrong data-start=\"226\" data-end=\"269\"\u003e8BitDo Ultimate 2C Bluetooth Controller\u003c\/strong\u003e — precision-engineered for speed, comfort, and durability. Featuring ultra-responsive Hall Effect sticks, customizable buttons, and turbo functions, this controller gives you the edge in every battle. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"a-size-base-plus a-text-bold\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout this item\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCompatible with Switch via Bluetooth. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eHall Effect joysticks with wear-resistant metal rings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eRefined bumpers and D-pad - Recalibrated for a clicky yet smooth feel.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eExtra R4\/L4 bumpers. Custom button mapping without using software.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eWake-on-shake. 6-axis motion control. Rumble Vibration. Turbo function.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFast button mapping. Refined ABXY buttons.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"8BitDo","offers":[{"title":"Pink","offer_id":47914068115678,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Blue","offer_id":47914068148446,"sku":null,"price":35.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/1_0c03b5c7-daa8-40c1-9a66-c486f3e359f2.jpg?v=1770910846"},{"product_id":"nintendo-switch™-2-joy-con™-2-pair-l-r-light-purple-and-light-green","title":"Nintendo Switch  2 Joy-Con 2 Pair (L)\/(R) - Light Purple and Light Green","description":"\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eJoy-Con 2 controllers: Left and right Joy-Con 2 controllers; includes two Joy-Con 2 straps; the updated Joy-Con 2 controllers have easy-to-use motion controls and HD rumble 2, along with the new C Button for easy GameChat access and all-new mouse controls in compatible games\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThis set includes both a left and right Joy-Con 2 controller, along with a pair of Joy-Con 2 straps, for local multiplayer with a friend in compatible games; only for use with Nintendo Switch 2\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eThe Nintendo Switch 2 console comes with one Joy-Con 2 L and one Joy-Con 2 R, and two Joy-Con 2 straps\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"Nintendo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":47981315817694,"sku":null,"price":75.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/61f4s0lQndL._SL1500_22a8170e-85f8-4c51-a39b-0d164b1e8366.jpg?v=1773412296"},{"product_id":"h-1","title":"8BitDo Ultimate 2 Wireless Controller with Charging Dock for Nintendo Switch\/Nintendo Switch 2 \u0026 Windows PC, with TMR Joysticks, Switchable Hall Effect\/Tactile Triggers, Vibration and Motion Control","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"nintendo switch; nintendo switch games; nintendo switch controller; nintendo switch controllers;\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/25238a10-b818-4eba-9f93-92d1c3460ab4.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/25238a10-b818-4eba-9f93-92d1c3460ab4.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 400;\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv lang=\"en_US\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"hnbqvk-ldkvs4-4m3ltn-l34sh8\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-content-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"rcb2ef-c37ksb-w2d2to-kzypco\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"nintendo switch; nintendo switch games; nintendo switch controller; nintendo switch controllers;\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/eb331399-4d9b-4616-a292-40e10c93c0d5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/eb331399-4d9b-4616-a292-40e10c93c0d5.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"ll17gz-xzkq9j-u282ih-4q2sc1\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"nintendo switch; nintendo switch games; nintendo switch controller; nintendo switch controllers;\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/857dcb60-02d1-4509-868a-dfbc8cd156f9.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/857dcb60-02d1-4509-868a-dfbc8cd156f9.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"vt0zbz-pmsyo1-gj4dsl-77ze2u\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"nintendo switch; nintendo switch games; nintendo switch controller; nintendo switch controllers;\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/153f2ea8-c619-4548-9c33-6f3057989e90.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/153f2ea8-c619-4548-9c33-6f3057989e90.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eFlagship, fully upgraded for next-level performance. Compatible with Switch, Switch 2, and Windows. Switch 2 compatibility requires the controller and adapter to be updated to the latest firmware.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTMR Joysticks – Offering higher sensitivity, greater precision, and enhanced durability, complete with an RGB Fire Ring and wear-resistant joystick rings.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eIntegrated Charging Dock - A seamlessly integrated charging dock keeps your controller always charged and ready to play. Automatically reconnects when removed from the dock.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eVibration and Motion control (for Switch only). Turbo function. Wake-on-shake. Support 8BitDo Ultimate Software V2.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTrigger Mode Switch - Easily switch between linear Hall Effect triggers and non-linear tactile triggers for optimal control across different gaming scenarios.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e2 Pro-level back buttons. Extra R4\/L4 bumpers. Tactile bumpers and D-pad. 3 custom profiles.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"8BitDo","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48385922760926,"sku":null,"price":55.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_9d72a428-f770-40c7-bcd3-9b6dcc867341.jpg?v=1782767694"},{"product_id":"gamesir-super-nova-tn4-2-4g-wireless-multiplatform-game-controller-for-pc-nintendo-switch-1-2-ios-android-devices-blue","title":"GameSir Super Nova TN4 2.4G Wireless Multiplatform Game Controller for PC, Nintendo Switch 1|2, iOS \u0026 Android Devices - Nightfall Blue","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" data-cel-widget=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-card1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"aplus_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"aplus\" data-template-name=\"aplus\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui-deck dp-widget-card-deck celwidget\" data-a-remove-top-gutter=\"\" data-a-remove-bottom-gutter=\"\" data-csa-c-id=\"wx250f-gvjjlt-ntrpog-afuowr\" data-cel-widget=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-27\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" data-cel-widget=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-card2\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Super NOVA\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7be550e0-6ff0-4838-afca-b231391dfce7.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/7be550e0-6ff0-4838-afca-b231391dfce7.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv lang=\"en_US\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-v2 mobile celwidget\" cel_widget_id=\"m-aplus\" data-csa-c-id=\"g053la-b9bip5-rsd2c7-50gxfo\" data-cel-widget=\"m-aplus\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"aplus-content-wrapper\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"asipls-jh2kwy-32v1uy-te51e3\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Super NOVA\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/9bb11995-380c-414a-bb9c-e9861ca6dc18.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/9bb11995-380c-414a-bb9c-e9861ca6dc18.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"ln8evv-rmr156-8wljj0-lszod7\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Super NOVA\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/aa87fe32-25a4-431d-bea1-54b655e00862.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/aa87fe32-25a4-431d-bea1-54b655e00862.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"celwidget aplus-module premium-module-2-fullbackground-image aplus-premium\" cel_widget_id=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\" data-csa-c-id=\"nxi5pv-dnfl91-qig41c-tvilth\" data-cel-widget=\"aplus-m-premium-module-2-fullbackground-image\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none premium-aplus premium-aplus-module-2\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\u003cimg alt=\"Super NOVA\" src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e6c517ca-926b-41af-8043-25afafe17fde.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\" class=\"background-image\" data-src=\"https:\/\/m.media-amazon.com\/images\/S\/aplus-media-library-service-media\/e6c517ca-926b-41af-8043-25afafe17fde.__CR0,0,600,450_PT0_SX600_V1___.jpg\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-section a-text-center\"\u003e\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"a-cardui feature\" data-a-card-type=\"basic\" data-cel-widget=\"\" name=\"a-cardui-deck-autoname-26-card3\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets_feature_div\" data-feature-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" data-template-name=\"featureBulletsAndDetailBullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; details\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"featurebullets_secondary_view_div\" class=\"a-section\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"feature-bullets\" class=\"a-section a-spacing-small\"\u003e\n\u003cul class=\"a-unordered-list a-vertical a-spacing-none\"\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eTri-Mode Universal Compatibility Seamlessly connect via Bluetooth 5.3\/2.4G dongle\/USB-C to PC, Switch, iOS, Android \u0026amp; Steam .\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eCharging Dock with Auto Start-Stop With RGB Charging Station Pick Up to Play \/ Place to Charge . GameSir Super Nova Built-in 1000 mAh high-capacity battery.Support you in your protracted battle.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e38dB Silent A\/B\/X\/Y Buttons Anti-rebound silicone pads reduce button noise to 38dB (quieter than a keyboard click), ideal for late-night gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eZero-Drift Hall Effect System Hall Effect joysticks (5 Million+ lifespan) + anti-friction rings，Two-stage Hall triggers: Short Travel (racing games) \/ Long Travel (shooter pressure control)\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e1000Hz Pro-Grade Response 1000Hz polling rate (wired\/2.4G) \u0026amp; 3ms latency for FPS\/MOBA dominance.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003e6-Axis Gyro \u0026amp; Turbo Function Native Switch motion controls，turbo fire，One-press wake-up for Switch Gaming\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eErgonomic Grip Design 2 programmable back buttons + laser-etched non-slip texture + 6° angled triggers for fatigue-free marathon gaming.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eDeep Customization via GameSir App Remap buttons, adjust trigger sensitivity, record macros \u0026amp; customize 5 RGB modes on Windows\/Android\/iOS.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli class=\"a-spacing-mini\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"a-list-item\"\u003eModular Aesthetic Kit (Faceplate Sold Separately) Swap ABXY layouts \u0026amp; magnetic faceplates (optional). Cycle through 5 RGB effects via software\/shortcut keys.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","brand":"Gamesir","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48603538817246,"sku":null,"price":45.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_998b0b88-4381-43fd-b035-ea8751c98687.jpg?v=1786749883"},{"product_id":"gamesir-nova-2-lite-multi-platform-tri-mode-wireless-game-controller-luminous-white","title":"GameSir Nova 2 Lite Multi-Platform Tri-Mode Wireless Game Controller - Luminous White","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTired of delayed inputs ruining your matches?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eThe\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGameSir Nova 2 Lite Multi-Platform Tri-Mode Wireless Game Controller (Luminous White)\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003edelivers fast response, flexible connectivity, and dependable control for competitive and casual gaming alike.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you play on PC, Switch, Android, or iOS, this\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGameSir Gamepad\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003eoffers broad compatibility without changing your gaming habits. Its Hall Effect technology, tri-mode connectivity, and customizable controls make it a practical choice for gamers searching for a reliable\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMultiplatform Gaming Controller\u003c\/strong\u003e. If you are looking for the\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGameSir Controller Price in Bangladesh\u003c\/strong\u003e, this model is available at PCB Store with trusted after-sales support across Bangladesh.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the GameSir Nova 2 Lite Multi-Platform Tri-Mode Wireless Game Controller?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eModern games demand fast reactions. A controller with inconsistent inputs or stick drift quickly becomes frustrating. The GameSir Nova 2 Lite focuses on responsive performance by combining Hall Effect sticks, Hall Effect triggers, and a 1000Hz polling rate over wired and wireless dongle connections.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIts tri-mode connectivity supports Bluetooth, wireless dongle, and wired operation. That flexibility makes it an excellent\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePC and Mobile Game Controller\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003efor players who regularly switch between gaming platforms.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eHow Does the GameSir Nova 2 Lite Perform?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe controller uses\u003cspan\u003e \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eGameSir Hall Effect sensing sticks\u003c\/strong\u003e, reducing the risk of stick drift while delivering consistent movement accuracy. Hall Effect triggers also provide smoother actuation and include trigger stops for players who prefer faster response during competitive gameplay.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUltra-low button and stick latency helps commands register quickly. Combined with the mechanical circular D-pad, directional movements feel accurate during platformers, fighting games, and retro titles.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDual asymmetric rumble motors add tactile feedback without affecting overall controller balance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eKey Features That Improve Everyday Gaming\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSeveral practical features separate this controller from standard wireless gamepads.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eTri-mode connectivity with Bluetooth, wireless dongle, and wired support\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHall Effect sticks designed for long-term durability\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eHall Effect triggers with adjustable trigger stops\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMechanical circular D-pad for responsive directional inputs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e1000Hz polling rate through wired and wireless dongle modes\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual macro back buttons supporting mapping and macro recording\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDual asymmetric vibration motors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAnti-slip laser-textured grips\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFull customization through GameSir Connect App and GameSir App\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe included 600mAh rechargeable battery also supports the optional smart auto start-stop charging station, compatible with the Super Nova charging dock.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Gamesir","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":48970776183006,"sku":null,"price":25.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0272\/9476\/1037\/files\/rn-image_picker_lib_temp_5dbdacc6-4689-41c3-b385-2ffb626cfae2.png?v=1788294448"}],"url":"https:\/\/www.gamers-stop.com\/collections\/nintendo-switch-2-controllers.oembed","provider":"Gamers Stop","version":"1.0","type":"link"}